# Tauri frontend (web/) + Rust bridge (src-tauri/)
# NOTE: build output goes to web-dist/, NOT dist/ - dist/ already holds
# tracked Linux/Windows packaging assets (see dist/windows/Cemu.manifest
# etc.), which `vite build`'s default empty-outDir-then-write behavior would
# otherwise silently wipe.
